{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twilight Requiem -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Embark on a Dark Fantasy odyssey in Twilight Requiem, an action RPG blending heart-pounding combat and mystical exploration. Wield cosmic powers, master fluid combos inspired by Kingdom Hearts 2 Final Mix, and traverse haunting realms through enigmatic portals. Unravel the mystery of Casia, a hero with no memory but a burning desire to save a world shrouded in darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Dynamic Combat**: Chain devastating combos and dodge with precision in fast-paced, Kingdom Hearts-style battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Mystical Portals**: Explore interconnected realms, from the cosmic Hub Stronghold to the eerie Mystical Cathedral Hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Dark Fantasy World**: Immerse yourself in a haunting narrative and Elden Ring-inspired environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Indie Passion**: Crafted by a solo dev and a dedicated team, with regular updates and community feedback shaping the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Wishlist now to join Casia\u2019s quest and stay updated on our progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Coming Soon to Steam.*</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830080?t=1753215860","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830080/9b96900e3e7c03c07bd8c3ab53f820f3b9bb7026/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753215860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830080/cfc6cb41de76d2b9da07dea4a45901665f6cd6b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753215860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830080/cfc6cb41de76d2b9da07dea4a45901665f6cd6b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753215860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"A